}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 One of the following, or some other Short Lesson of Scripture\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 appropriate to the occasion or to the season, may then be read.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Jesus said, {\u8220\'93}You are the light of the world. A city built on a\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 hill cannot be hid. No one lights a lamp to put it under a\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 bucket, but on a lamp-stand where it gives light for everyone\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 in the house. And you, like the lamp, must shed light among\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 your fellow men, so that they may see the good you do, and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 give glory to your Father in heaven.{\u8221\'94}  }{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Matthew 5:14-16\par
}\column 
\pard \fs24\tx-1440\tx-720\tx0\tx972\tx1422\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 It is not ourselves that we proclaim; we proclaim Christ\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Jesus as Lord, and ourselves as your servants, for Jesus' sake.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 For the same God who said, {\u8220\'93}Out of darkness let light shine,{\u8221\'94}\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 has caused his light to shine within us, to give the light of\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 revelation {\u8212\'97} the revelation of the glory of God in the face of\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Jesus Christ.  }{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 2 Corinthians 4:5-6}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 If I say, {\u8220\'93}Surely the darkness will cover me, and the light\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 around me turn to night,{\u8221\'94} darkness is not dark to you, O\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Lord; the night is as bright as the day; darkness and light to\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 you are both alike.  }{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Psalm 139:10-11}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 The Officiant then says the Prayer for Light, using any one of the\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 following or some other suitable prayer, first saying}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-1440\tx-720\tx0\tx972\tx1422\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-1440\tx-720\tx0\tx972\tx1422\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Let us pray. \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-1440\tx-720\tx0\tx972\tx1422\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-1440\tx-720\tx0\tx972\tx1422\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Almighty God, we give you thanks for surrounding us, as\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 daylight fades, with the brightness of the vesper light; and we\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 implore you of your great mercy that, as you enfold us with\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 the radiance of this light, so you would shine into our hearts\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 the brightness of your Holy Spirit; through Jesus Christ our\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Lord.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Grant us, Lord, the lamp of charity which never fails, that it\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 may burn in us and shed its light on those around us, and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 that by its brightness we may have a vision of that holy City,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 where dwells the true and never-failing Light, Jesus Christ\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 our Lord.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen}{\plain \fs24 \f3 .\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 O Lord God Almighty, as you have taught us to call the\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 evening, the morning, and the noonday one day; and have\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 made the sun to know its going down:  Dispel the darkness of\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 our hearts, that by your brightness we may know you to be\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 the true God and eternal light, living and reigning for ever\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and ever.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen}{\plain \fs24 \f3 .\par
}\column 
\pard \fs24\tx-1440\tx-720\tx0\tx972\tx1422\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Lighten our darkness, we beseech thee, O Lord; and by thy\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 great mercy defend us from all perils and dangers of this\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 night; for the love of thy only Son, our Savior, Jesus Christ.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
