}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 lamps as may be convenient.\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 During the candle-lighting, an appropriate anthem or psalm may be\par
