{\plain \fs24 \f3 You are worthy at all times to be praised by happy voices,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 O Son of God, O Giver of life,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and to be glorified through all the worlds. \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 The service may then continue in any of the following ways:\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 With Evening Prayer, beginning with the Psalms; or with some other Office \softline
or Devotion.\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 With the celebration of the Holy Eucharist, beginning with the Salutation \softline
and Collect of the Day; \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Or, it may be followed by a meal or other activity, in which case Phos\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 hilaron may be followed by the Lord's Prayer and a grace or blessing;}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Or, it may continue as a complete evening Office with the following\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 elements:}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\column 
\pard \fs20\tx-1440\tx-720\tx0\tx972\tx1422\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
